      en: ["Once a major center for pineapple exports during the 19th century.", "Home to the Macmillan-Hughes art gallery in a historic building.", "Famous for the daily fish market held at the public pier.", "The settlement is located about 10 kilometers south of Rock Sound.", "Features a protected natural harbor for small fishing boats.", "The architecture includes many buildings from the Victorian era."],
